end="02:44.577">I </span><span begin="02:44.577" end="02:45.585">broke </span><span begin="02:46.336" end="02:46.521">my </span><span begin="02:46.521" end="02:47.322">promise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.241" end="02:54.241"><span begin="02:50.241" end="02:50.441">I </span><span begin="02:50.441" end="02:50.808">called </span><span begin="02:50.808" end="02:52.577">you </span><span begin="02:52.577" end="02:53.184">last </span><span begin="02:53.184" end="02:54.241">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.744" end="03:01.880"><span begin="02:56.744" end="02:56.955">I </span><span begin="02:56.955" end="02:57.321">shouldn't </span><span begin="02:57.321" end="02:58.601">have </span><span begin="02:59.513" end="02:59.769">I </span><span begin="02:59.769" end="03:00.528">wouldn't </span><span begin="03:00.528" end="03:01.880">have</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.232" end="03:06.433"><span begin="03:02.232" end="03:02.474">If </span><span begin="03:02.474" end="03:02.785">it </span><span begin="03:02.785" end="03:03.280">weren't </span><span begin="03:03.433" end="03:03.755">for </span><span begin="03:03.755" end="03:04.057">the </span><span begin="03:04.057" end="03:04.609">sight </span><span begin="03:04.776" end="03:04.992">of </span><span begin="03:04.992" end="03:05.490">a </span><span begin="03:05.490" end="03:06.433">boy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.816" end="03:09.713"><span begin="03:06.816" end="03:07.369">Who </span><span begin="03:07.369" end="03:07.944">looked </span><span begin="03:07.944" end="03:08.545">just </span><span begin="03:08.545" end="03:09.240">like </span><span begin="03:09.240" end="03:09.713">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.921" end="03:17.208"><span begin="03:09.921" end="03:11.019">Standing </span><span begin="03:11.281" end="03:11.937">out </span><span begin="03:11.937" end="03:12.657">on </span><span begin="03:12.657" end="03:14.257">Melrose </span><span begin="03:14.601" end="03:17.2